<title>HONG KONG: HK's Chekiang First Bank sets HK$1.0 bln FRCD.</title>
<headline>HK's Chekiang First Bank sets HK$1.0 bln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by coordinating arranger DKB Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER    CHEKIANG FIRST BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT	HK$1.0 BLN COUPON	3MH+33   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRCD	 ISS PRICE   PAR	LAUNCH    17.MAR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	 CALLS	 NONE     REPLIES   02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING     NONE	 REPAYMENT   BULLET   DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING	IBCA A+**  SALE LMTS  CUSTOMARY TAX PROV  FREE&amp;CLR</p>
<p> NEG PLG     --	   CRS DEF     --	 FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   ***	  GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PAY DATE  ****</p>
<p> PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS   HK$70-99 MLN   27BP  ALL-IN  42</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS    HK$50-69 MLN   24BP  ALL-IN  41</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	     HK$30-49 MLN   21BP  ALL-IN  40</p>
<p> COORDINATING ARRANGERS    BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK HONG KONG</p>
<p>				   (BOOKS), SCHRODERS ASIA (BOOKS), HSBC</p>
<p>				   MARKETS (BOOKS) AND DKB ASIA.</p>
<p> PAYING AGENT		  CHEKIANG FIRST BANK</p>
<p> NOTES    DIRECT, UNSUBORDINATED, UNCONDITIONAL, UNSECURED AND</p>
<p>	    RANKED  PARI PASSU.</p>
<p>	   *APPLICATION WILL BE MADE TO THE HONG KONG MONETARY</p>
<p>	    AUTHORITY TO ACCEPT THE ISSUE AS ELIGIBLE FOR ITS</p>
<p>	    LIQUIDITY ADJUSTMENT FACILITY (LAF), OR DISCOUNT</p>
<p>	    WINDOW.</p>
<p>	  **ISSUER RATING A-PLUS BY IBCA</p>
<p>	 ***THE ISSUER, BASED IN HONG KONG, IS WHOLLY-OWNED BY</p>
<p>	    DAI-ICHI KANGYO BANK.</p>
<p>****DEPOSIT DATE WITHIN 14 DAYS AFTER SIGNING</p>
<p>	    CLEARING THROUGH HKMA'S CENTRAL MONEYMARKETS UNIT</p>
<p>	    A GROUP OF ARRANGERS IS BEING FORMED.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
